IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `taa-tfn-payg`

-- Taxation Administration Act 1953 (Cth), s 8C(2), ss 8WA, 8WB, Schedule 1 Parts 2-5 and 2-10 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_taxation-administration-act-1953.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*): Chloe turns 15 on 14 March 2018 and takes a casual job
-- at a supermarket (c020); her first graduate payslip on 29 February 2024 is $5,833.33 for the month (c041, $70,000 a year).
-- Jake turns 15 on 30 August 2021, with a TFN and no job (k020); on 20 October 2028 he lodges his first return as a sole trader
-- on $31,000 and asks about PAYG instalments; GST is not required under $75,000 (k043). Daniel turns 16 on 15 October 2012 and
-- takes a casual job (d012).
-- The scenarios give no amounts withheld, no employer size, no notional tax and no date on which the Commissioner gives Jake an
-- instalment rate. The schedule amount (1000), the notional tax (2500), the rate (8%), the instalment income (7750, a quarter of
-- $31,000) and the date the rate is given (15 November 2028) are the encoder's, HYPOTHETICAL, and are not in the Act.
-- d012 is in 2012; the text encoded is the 2026 compilation, not the law as it stood then.

`c020: the supermarket asks Chloe for her TFN for a TFN declaration` MEANS `TFN request` WITH
    `a taxation law provides for the number to be quoted to this person` IS TRUE
    `in connection with a function or obligation under a taxation law` IS TRUE
    `acting on the other person's behalf` IS FALSE
    `for an ABN application` IS FALSE
    `only asks for a document from which the TFN may be removed` IS FALSE

`a video store asks for a TFN as proof of identity` MEANS `TFN request` WITH
    `a taxation law provides for the number to be quoted to this person` IS FALSE
    `in connection with a function or obligation under a taxation law` IS FALSE
    `acting on the other person's behalf` IS FALSE
    `for an ABN application` IS FALSE
    `only asks for a document from which the TFN may be removed` IS FALSE

